{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cuv","name":"新標點和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CUV","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (traditional)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"923f114ccc6ab7fc558e054f84df5214fa9782ca7c02882cf173417a0d1d641e","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"PSA","translationId":"cmn_cuv","name":"詩篇","commonName":"詩篇","title":"詩篇","order":19,"numberOfChapters":150,"sha256":"fcaa20905e646fef52638ee11406d121669ccd5d9c1cdf8154b5f6c31cc2988f","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/PSA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":150,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/PSA/150.json","totalNumberOfVerses":2452},"chapter":{"number":54,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["遭敵迫害求主保護"]},{"type":"hebrew_subtitle","content":["西弗人來對掃羅說：「大衛豈不是在我們那裏藏身嗎？」那時，大衛作這訓誨詩，交與伶長。用絲弦的樂器。"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"上帝啊，求你以你的名救我，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"憑你的大能為我伸冤。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"上帝啊，求你聽我的禱告，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"留心聽我口中的言語。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為，外人起來攻擊我，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"強暴人尋索我的命；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們眼中沒有上帝。（細拉）","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"text":"上帝是幫助我的，是扶持我命的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他要報應我仇敵所行的惡；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"求你憑你的誠實滅絕他們。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"text":"我要把甘心祭獻給你。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華啊，我要稱讚你的名；這名本為美好。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他從一切的急難中把我救出來；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我的眼睛也看見了我仇敵遭報。","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/PSA/54.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/PSA/55.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/PSA/53.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":7}